    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.poster.avif?t=1681359966\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.webm?t=1681359966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.mp4?t=1681359966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Blaston is a fast-paced PvP VR shooter where your survival hinges on one simple rule: Never. Stay. Still.<br><br>Duel players in a slow-motion bullet-hell as you collect weapons, personalize your loadout, and move your whole body to dodge oncoming fire as you line up your next perfect shot. Customize your weapons with game-changing attachments, glow up your avatar and arsenal with new looks, and create player-hosted tournaments in the Ozo Lounge. Get ready to break a sweat!<br><br>\ud83d\udca5 FREE-TO-PLAY \u2014 Everyone can get in on the action and take aim on the competition<br>\ud83d\udca5 REVAMPED STORE \u2014 Re-organized with all new categories for an improved player experience<br>\ud83d\udca5 MORE WEAPON ATTACHMENTS \u2014 24 brand new options for 8 different weapon types<br>\ud83d\udca5 MORE STYLE OPTIONS \u2014 New avatar and weapon skins are ready to equip<br><br>Blaston Spectator app available for PC.<br><br>Blaston \u2014 a game of firepower and physicality from the cyberpunk warriors at Resolution Games.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.poster.avif?t=1681359966\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.webm?t=1681359966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.mp4?t=1681359966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Blaston is a fast-paced PvP VR shooter where your survival hinges on one simple rule: Never. Stay. Still.<br><br>Duel players in a slow-motion bullet-hell as you collect weapons, personalize your loadout, and move your whole body to dodge oncoming fire as you line up your next perfect shot. Customize your weapons with game-changing attachments, glow up your avatar and arsenal with new looks, and create player-hosted tournaments in the Ozo Lounge. Get ready to break a sweat!<br><br>\ud83d\udca5 FREE-TO-PLAY \u2014 Everyone can get in on the action and take aim on the competition<br>\ud83d\udca5 REVAMPED STORE \u2014 Re-organized with all new categories for an improved player experience<br>\ud83d\udca5 MORE WEAPON ATTACHMENTS \u2014 24 brand new options for 8 different weapon types<br>\ud83d\udca5 MORE STYLE OPTIONS \u2014 New avatar and weapon skins are ready to equip<br><br>Blaston Spectator app available for PC.<br><br>Blaston \u2014 a game of firepower and physicality from the cyberpunk warriors at Resolution Games.",
    "short_description": "In the slow-motion bullet-hell of Blaston, you duck, dodge, and weave to evade incoming attacks while preparing your dazzling next combos in a flash of skill. You feel like Neo and leave each session with your heart racing in this super fun tactical workout. Most importantly... Never. Stay. Still.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Swedish, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cOne of the Best VR Experiences of 2020... with a surprising amount of strategy.\u201d<br>5/5 \u2013 TheGamer<br><br>\u201cWhether you\u2019re a fan of competitive 1v1 battles, strategy-based gunplay, or just enjoy dodging bullets Keanu Reeves-style, Blaston is an absolute must-buy.\u201d<br>VR Scout<br><br>\u201cChallenges the notion of what a \u2018VR shooter\u2019 can be...a genius arrangement\u201d<br>RoadToVR<br>",
